{"variant": "U2_expl_fmt", "id": "seed-composite_injective_implies_first", "repeat": 0, "tier": "medium", "field": "discrete-logic", "language": "ja", "outcome": "answered", "reason": null, "kind": "prove", "answer": null, "tactic": "exact?", "tactic_text": "intros; exact?", "verified": true, "formal": "∀ (A B C : Type) (f : A → B) (g : B → C), Function.Injective (g ∘ f) → Function.Injective f", "proved": "∀ (A B C : Type) (f : A → B) (g : B → C), Function.Injective (g ∘ f) → Function.Injective f", "explanation": "写像の合成が単射であるという仮定のもとで、$f$ の単射性を示すには、$f$ の値が等しい任意の二つの入力が等しいことを示せばよい。\n\n$x,y\\in A$ を取り、$f(x)=f(y)$ と仮定する。両辺に $g$ を適用すると $g(f(x))=g(f(y))$ となり、合成写像の定義から $(g\\circ f)(x)=(g\\circ f)(y)$ を得る。\n\n仮定より $g\\circ f$ は単射なので、この等式から $x=y$ が従う。したがって、$f(x)=f(y)$ ならば常に $x=y$ である。\n\nゆえに、$g\\circ f$ が単射ならば $f$ も単射である。", "request": "写像$f:A\\to B$、$g:B\\to C$について、合成写像$g\\circ f$が単射なら$f$も単射であることを証明せよ。", "seconds": {"first_call": 2.492, "closed": 3.305, "verified": 3.9, "gate": 4.551, "explained": 6.881, "explanation_review": 2.661, "reviewed": 9.542, "total": 9.542}, "explanation_approved": true, "explanation_issue": "", "item_usd": 0.000832, "statements": ["∀ (A B C : Type) (f : A → B) (g : B → C), Function.Injective (g ∘ f) → Function.Injective f"], "gate": {"passed": true, "reasons": [], "agree": true, "reviewed": true, "roundtrip": true, "issue": "", "rt_issue": ""}, "calls": [{"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1370, "input_tokens": 463, "output_tokens": 85, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.492, "seconds": 2.492, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1370, "input_tokens": 463, "output_tokens": 110, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.958, "seconds": 2.957, "error": null}, {"label": "merged", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "none", "prompt_chars": 1370, "input_tokens": 463, "output_tokens": 117, "start": 0.001, "end": 3.117, "seconds": 3.117, "error": null}, {"label": "review_terse", "model": "gpt